  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final Evaluation of the Program -  FRESAN - Fortalecimento da Resili&#xea;ncia e da Seguran&#xe7;a Alimentar e Nutricional em Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The porpose of this contract is to conduct a Final Evaluation of the FRESAN - Fortalecimento da Resili&#xea;ncia e da Seguran&#xe7;a Alimentar e Nutricional em Angola Program, taking into account from the recommendations of the project to Support the monitoring and follow-up of the FRESAN Program (where available), the issues raised at the Mid-term review (where available) and ROM evaluations (where available), focusing mainly on the impact and sustainability of the intervention of the programme in Strengthening Resilience and Food and Nutrition Security in in the south of Angola: Cunene, Hu&#xed;la and Namibe. The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and other audience with:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an overall independent assessment of the program for Strengthening Resilience and Food and Nutrition Security in Angola, paying particular attention to its resultsachieved against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve current and future Interventions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
